Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:53.30,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单16强
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:53.30,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 斯瓦泰克 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:02.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Qinwen, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,钦文 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.40,EN,,0,0,0,,What an unbelievable performance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,刚刚那场表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,But I have to ask in the previous round
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我必须问一下 上一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:16.96,EN,,0,0,0,,against Madison Keys,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,对阵凯斯那场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,you were down five zero in the third set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你决胜盘 0-5 落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Here again in the first set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天第一盘又是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,how are you making these comebacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么完成这些逆转的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I have to say I start the match not so well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得说 开场我打得不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and after, little by little, I find
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我一点一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:37.76,EN,,0,0,0,,my rhythm on the center court cuz it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,找回了中央球场的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,been a long long time I haven't play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为已经很久很久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.72,EN,,0,0,0,,on the center court,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没在中央球场打过了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I just really appreciate it to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很珍惜能站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in the Ashe Stadium first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,站在阿什球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:47.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And second, I just focus point by point
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二 我就是一分一分地打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and little by little I start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后一点一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to play better tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出更好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I start to find my game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我开始找回自己的球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:58.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and in one moment I even forgot the score
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一刻我甚至忘了比分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.64,EN,,0,0,0,,in the first set at 4-5.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在第一盘 4-5 的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.80,EN,,0,0,0,,That shows how I am focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这说明我有多专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:06.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Well I guess to come back 0-5 yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,昨天从 0-5 追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:07.60,EN,,0,0,0,,is not lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是靠运气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:11.56,EN,,0,0,0,,That's all I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只能说这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been a very difficult head-to-head
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你和斯瓦泰克的交手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,with Iga.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直非常艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,She's won six out of six matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,六次交手她赢了六次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.32,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you do differently today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天你做了什么不一样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I think in the baseline I try to play more flat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,底线上我试着打得更平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,against her because I think she's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为她的上旋球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,has really good top spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,质量真的很高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Makes me feel really uncomfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我很不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:35.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and I try to play more aggressive
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我打得更主动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.84,EN,,0,0,0,,because I remember when I just came
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我记得刚打巡回赛时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.00,EN,,0,0,0,,on the tour the match I lost against her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,输给她的那些场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,is because I wasn't aggressive enough
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是因为我不够主动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and I tried to stay with her as long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,只想着尽量跟她周旋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just really happy to match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很高兴赢下这场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:49.12,EN,,0,0,0,,because it's not easy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's been a while really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且真的隔了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:53.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't beat any top 10 player.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直没赢过前 10 的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I just really really appreciated this win
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的非常珍惜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:56.72,EN,,0,0,0,,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:59.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And I want to say thank you for all the fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想谢谢所有的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,who come to support me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天来现场支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:03.68,EN,,0,0,0,,And I hope you guys enjoy tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望你们享受这场网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,And last thing I want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后我想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to say thanks to my team
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,because we've been working really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们一直非常努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:13.16,EN,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:13.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我才能站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Qinwen, you were out with injury
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,钦文 你因伤缺席了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,相当长一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:21.84,EN,,0,0,0,,You made it through the qualifying here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你从这里的资格赛打上来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.76,EN,,0,0,0,,but now you're into the quarterfinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在已经打进 8 强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,You're playing some
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你打出的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:27.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of the best tennis we've ever seen from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们见过你最好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.28,0:02:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.28,0:02:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你准备好继续走下去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I have to say more matches I play,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得说 打的比赛越多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:35.76,EN,,0,0,0,,more rhythm I got on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,场上的节奏就越好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,People often ask me if you are tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,常有人问我累不累
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:39.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, when I arrive to here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我到这儿的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not tired at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,一点都不累
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I just feel really pumped for my next match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对下一场充满干劲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Trying to reach better level here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,想在这里打到更高的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Trying to show my tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,想展示我的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:51.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and enjoy at this fantastic stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,享受这座了不起的球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
